711
01:11:03.054 --> 01:11:07.930
- And you ran away?
- No. First I tried to free them.

712
01:11:08.059 --> 01:11:11.808
I opened the gate to their pen.
but they wouldn't run.

713
01:11:11.938 --> 01:11:15.639
They just stood there. confused.
They wouldn't run.

714
01:11:15.775 --> 01:11:18.812
But you could - and you did. didn't you?

715
01:11:18.945 --> 01:11:22.646
Yes. I took one lamb
and I ran away as fast as I could.

716
01:11:22.782 --> 01:11:27.076
- Where were you going. Clarice?
- I don't know. I didn't have any food.

717
01:11:27.204 --> 01:11:30.489
any water and it was very cold. very cold.

718
01:11:32.667 --> 01:11:34.660
I thought...

719
01:11:34.795 --> 01:11:37.879
I thought if I could save just one. but...

720
01:11:39.299 --> 01:11:41.872
He was so heavy.

721
01:11:42.010 --> 01:11:44.050
So heavy.

722
01:11:48.850 --> 01:11:53.643
I didn't get more than a few miles
when the sheriff's car picked me up.

723
01:11:55.982 --> 01:12:00.858
The rancher was so angry. he sent me
to live at the orphanage in Bozeman.

724
01:12:00.987 --> 01:12:03.229
I never saw the ranch again.

725
01:12:03.698 --> 01:12:06.403
What became of your lamb. Clarice?

726
01:12:08.411 --> 01:12:12.195
- He killed him.
- You still wake up sometimes. don't you?

727
01:12:12.332 --> 01:12:14.823
Wake up in the dark

728
01:12:14.960 --> 01:12:17.711
and hear the screaming of the lambs?

729
01:12:18.296 --> 01:12:20.336
Yes.

730
01:12:21.007 --> 01:12:25.219
And you think. if you save poor Catherine.
you could make them stop. don't you?

731
01:12:25.345 --> 01:12:27.503
You think if Catherine lives.

732
01:12:27.639 --> 01:12:31.008
you won't wake up in the dark ever again

733
01:12:31.143 --> 01:12:33.978
to that awful screaming of the lambs.

734
01:12:35.147 --> 01:12:36.557
I don't know.

735
01:12:37.232 --> 01:12:39.106
I don't know.

736
01:12:40.235 --> 01:12:42.274
Thank you. Clarice.

737
01:12:43.113 --> 01:12:47.407
- Thank you.
- Tell me his name. Doctor.

738
01:12:53.540 --> 01:12:56.327
Dr Chilton. I presume.

739
01:12:56.460 --> 01:12:58.915
I think you know each other.

740
01:13:00.380 --> 01:13:02.420
OK.

741
01:13:03.216 --> 01:13:06.751
- Let's go.
- It's your turn. Doctor.

742
01:13:06.887 --> 01:13:08.963
- Out.
- Tell me his name.

743
01:13:09.097 --> 01:13:13.225
Sorry. ma'am. I've got orders. I have
to put you on a plane. Come on now.

744
01:13:13.351 --> 01:13:15.640
Brave Clarice.

745
01:13:15.770 --> 01:13:19.353
You will let me know when those lambs
stop screaming. won't you?

746
01:13:19.483 --> 01:13:24.026
- Tell me his name. Doctor.
- Clarice.

747
01:13:24.154 --> 01:13:26.859
Your case file.

748
01:13:31.036 --> 01:13:33.787
Goodbye. Clarice.

749
01:14:38.520 --> 01:14:42.565
- Ready when you are. doc.
- Just another minute. please.

750
01:14:51.700 --> 01:14:56.243
Son of a bitch demanded a second
dinner. Lamb chops. extra rare.

751
01:14:56.371 --> 01:15:01.199
I wonder what he wants for breakfast.
Some damn thing from the zoo?

752
01:15:22.439 --> 01:15:26.187
- Good evening. gentlemen.
- OK. doc. Grab some floor.

753
01:15:26.318 --> 01:15:28.357
Same drill as before. please.

754
01:15:35.202 --> 01:15:37.989
Ready when you are. Sergeant Pembry.

755
01:15:54.012 --> 01:15:56.052
OK.

756
01:16:02.020 --> 01:16:04.060
Hand me that. would ya?

757
01:16:09.361 --> 01:16:11.400
Thanks.

758
01:16:14.366 --> 01:16:17.153
Mind the drawings. please.

759
01:16:19.371 --> 01:16:21.410
Thank you.

760
01:16:45.063 --> 01:16:47.768
Watch it. He's cuffed me!

761
01:16:54.322 --> 01:16:56.362
Jesus Christ!

762
01:18:14.611 --> 01:18:17.398
Ready when you are. Sergeant Pembry.

763
01:18:26.540 --> 01:18:28.616
What is this shit?

764
01:18:30.919 --> 01:18:34.751
- Did somebody go up on five?
- No. Nobody went up.

765
01:18:34.881 --> 01:18:38.001
Call Pembry. Ask him to tell...

766
01:18:39.511 --> 01:18:43.674
CP. Shots fired on five.
Repeat: shots fired on five.

767
01:18:43.807 --> 01:18:45.846
Sergeant Tate.

768
01:18:47.936 --> 01:18:50.557
- Holy shit.
- What the hell...?

769
01:18:51.815 --> 01:18:54.388
Shut up. Bobby. get the vest.

770
01:18:54.526 --> 01:18:57.361
- Right. sarge.
- Brady. Howard. cover...

771
01:18:57.487 --> 01:18:59.527
Look!

772
01:19:01.491 --> 01:19:05.952
- It's stopped.
- Seal off a ten-block radius.

773
01:19:06.079 --> 01:19:08.831
Get me the SWAT team
and an ambulance double-quick.

774
01:19:08.957 --> 01:19:10.914
We're goin' up.

775
01:19:39.362 --> 01:19:41.438
Pembry!

776
01:19:42.407 --> 01:19:44.447
Boyle!

777
01:19:56.880 --> 01:19:59.122
Oh. God.

778
01:20:05.305 --> 01:20:07.345
Go.

779
01:20:14.314 --> 01:20:17.434
- Clear.
- Command post.

780
01:20:17.567 --> 01:20:20.023
Two officers down.

781
01:20:21.363 --> 01:20:24.566
- Lecter's gone. sarge.
- Prisoner is missing.

782
01:20:24.699 --> 01:20:29.160
- Boyle's gun is gone. Sergeant.
- Repeat: Lecter is missing and armed.

783
01:20:29.287 --> 01:20:33.665
He's stripped the bed. Might be
makin' a rope. Check all windows.

784
01:20:34.209 --> 01:20:36.700
Where the fuck is my ambulance?

785
01:20:37.337 --> 01:20:41.549
He's alive. Sergeant Tate. he's alive.

786
01:20:41.883 --> 01:20:45.466
Get a hold of him
and feel his hand. Talk to him.

787
01:20:45.595 --> 01:20:49.379
- What do I say?
- It's Jim Pembry. Talk to him. dammit!

788
01:20:50.725 --> 01:20:52.848
Lecter is missing and armed.

789
01:20:52.978 --> 01:20:55.184
Pembry. can you hear me?

790
01:20:55.313 --> 01:21:00.225
He took Boyle's gun. Pembry got off one
round. There's a chance Lecter was hit.

791
01:21:00.360 --> 01:21:04.192
Keep breathin' in and out.
That's it. You're doing a good job.

792
01:21:04.322 --> 01:21:06.695
You look real good.

793
01:21:06.825 --> 01:21:09.695
Yeah. you look real good.

794
01:21:26.678 --> 01:21:28.552
- You ready?
- Let's do it.

795
01:21:28.680 --> 01:21:30.720
Let's go.

796
01:21:41.026 --> 01:21:45.189
Looking good. Pembry. You're gonna
make it. You're doin' just fine.

797
01:21:45.322 --> 01:21:47.729
I need that IV now!

798
01:21:47.866 --> 01:21:51.946
Can we get the straps?
Where's the fucking oxygen?

799
01:21:52.078 --> 01:21:54.534
Stay with me. Stay with me here.

800
01:21:55.582 --> 01:21:58.038
We're losin' him. Downstairs.

801
01:21:58.668 --> 01:22:01.242
And up.

802
01:22:01.379 --> 01:22:03.419
Elevator!

803
01:22:09.012 --> 01:22:10.839
CP to Tate.

804
01:22:10.972 --> 01:22:13.843
Roger. Lieutenant. Tate here.

805
01:22:13.975 --> 01:22:16.929
I'm on the elevator
bringing Pembry down.

806
01:22:17.062 --> 01:22:19.553
He seems to be hangin' on.

807
01:22:19.689 --> 01:22:22.180
Top three floors secured.

808
01:22:22.317 --> 01:22:24.357
Main stairwell secured.

809
01:22:25.403 --> 01:22:27.443
We think he's on two.

810
01:22:40.460 --> 01:22:42.916
Tate. are you still with me?

811
01:22:44.548 --> 01:22:49.790
We're pretty sure he's somewhere on two.
sir. That's all for now. Over.

812
01:23:08.488 --> 01:23:10.944
He's on the roof of the elevator.

813
01:23:13.577 --> 01:23:15.569
OK. guys.

814
01:23:31.678 --> 01:23:33.053
I see him.

815
01:23:33.180 --> 01:23:35.468
There's a gun by his hand.
He's not moving.

816
01:23:36.266 --> 01:23:39.101
- One warning: we need him alive.
- Got it.

817
01:23:40.145 --> 01:23:43.015
Lecter. put your hands on your head.

818
01:23:45.984 --> 01:23:48.024
One in the leg.

819
01:23:58.538 --> 01:24:00.697
No movement.

820
01:24:01.291 --> 01:24:04.411
Johnny. hold your fire.
We're comin' into the car.

821
01:24:04.544 --> 01:24:06.833
We're openin' the hatch.

822
01:24:06.963 --> 01:24:10.167
Watch his hands.
If there's any fire. it'll come from us.

823
01:24:10.300 --> 01:24:12.376
- Affirm.
- Got it.

824
01:24:38.495 --> 01:24:40.534
Memphis General. medical unit 26.

825
01:24:40.664 --> 01:24:45.076
We're inbound with a male police officer
with severe facial lacerations.

826
01:24:45.210 --> 01:24:49.836
Weapon unknown. We've got grand mal
seizure activity but he's post-ictal now.

827
01:24:49.965 --> 01:24:52.919
Vital signs are good.
Pressure is 1 30 over 90.

828
01:24:53.051 --> 01:24:55.459
- 90?
- Yeah. that's right. 90. Pulse 84.

829
01:24:55.595 --> 01:25:00.553
We got him on lactated Ringer's and
the patient is on ten litres of oxygen...

830
01:25:07.357 --> 01:25:12.814
They found the ambulance in a parking
garage at the airport. Crew was dead.

831
01:25:13.280 --> 01:25:17.028
He killed a tourist. too.
Got his clothes. cash.

832
01:25:17.450 --> 01:25:20.701
- By now he could be anywhere.
- He won't come after me.

833
01:25:20.829 --> 01:25:23.118
- Oh. really?
- He won't.

834
01:25:23.248 --> 01:25:27.791
I can't explain it.
He would consider that rude.

835
01:25:27.919 --> 01:25:31.787
- It's over. She's dead.
- It's not your fault it worked out like this.

836
01:25:31.923 --> 01:25:36.336
The thing is that Lecter said everything
we need to catch him is in these pages.

837
01:25:36.470 --> 01:25:38.961
Dr Lecter said a lot of things.

838
01:25:39.097 --> 01:25:41.553
He's here. Ardelia.

839
01:26:10.086 --> 01:26:12.542
Is this Lecter's handwriting?

840
01:26:13.924 --> 01:26:18.420
"Clarice. doesn't this random scattering
of sites seem desperately random.

841
01:26:18.553 --> 01:26:22.385
Iike the elaboration of a bad liar?
Hannibal Lecter."

842
01:26:22.516 --> 01:26:25.220
Desperately random?
What does he mean?

843
01:26:25.352 --> 01:26:29.848
Not random at all. maybe.
Like there's some pattern here.

844
01:26:29.981 --> 01:26:33.185
But there is no pattern
or the computers would have nailed it.

845
01:26:33.318 --> 01:26:37.945
- They were even found in random order.
- Random because of the one girl.

846
01:26:38.073 --> 01:26:42.071
- The one he weighted down.
- Fredrica Bimmel.

847
01:26:42.410 --> 01:26:45.577
From Belvedere. Ohio.

848
01:26:45.705 --> 01:26:48.659
First girl taken. third body found.

849
01:26:48.792 --> 01:26:51.709
- Why?
- She didn't drift. He weighted her down.

850
01:26:51.837 --> 01:26:55.206
What did Lecter say
about the first principles?

851
01:26:55.340 --> 01:27:00.500
- Simplicity.
- What does this guy do? He covets.

852
01:27:00.637 --> 01:27:03.175
How do we first start to covet?

853
01:27:03.557 --> 01:27:06.973
- We covet what we see...
- Every day.

854
01:27:08.895 --> 01:27:12.181
- Hot damn. Clarice.
- He knew her.

855
01:27:16.862 --> 01:27:20.562
BELVEDERE. OHIO

856
01:28:27.307 --> 01:28:29.347
- Mr Bimmel?
- That's me.

857
01:28:30.519 --> 01:28:33.092
I'm Clarice Starling. I'm with the FBl.

858
01:28:37.025 --> 01:28:40.608
I sure appreciate you letting me
take a look around. Mr Bimmel.

859
01:28:40.737 --> 01:28:42.979
I don't know nothin' new to tell ya.

860
01:28:43.114 --> 01:28:46.530
Police been back here
so many times already.

861
01:28:46.660 --> 01:28:50.823
Fredrica went into Chicago
on the bus to see about a job.

862
01:28:50.956 --> 01:28:54.490
She left the interview OK.
She never come home.

863
01:28:57.379 --> 01:28:59.786
Her bedroom's how she left it.

864
01:28:59.923 --> 01:29:02.544
Upstairs. Door to the left.

865
01:31:48.300 --> 01:31:51.751
He's making himself a "woman suit".
Mr Crawford. out of real women.

866
01:31:51.887 --> 01:31:54.425
He can sew. this guy. He's very skilled.

867
01:31:54.556 --> 01:31:56.928
- He's a tailor or a dressmaker.
- Starling...

868
01:31:57.058 --> 01:32:00.677
That's why they're so big. He has to
keep them alive so he can starve them.

869
01:32:00.812 --> 01:32:04.477
- so that he can loosen their skin.
- Starling. we know who he is.

870
01:32:04.608 --> 01:32:06.684
And where he is.
We're on our way right now.

871
01:32:06.818 --> 01:32:09.772
- Where?
- Calumet City. edge of Chicago.

872
01:32:09.905 --> 01:32:12.656
Be on the ground in 45 minutes.

873
01:32:12.782 --> 01:32:14.989
That's great news. sir. but how...

874
01:32:15.118 --> 01:32:18.701
Johns Hopkins came up with some
names. We fed 'em into Known Offenders.

875
01:32:18.830 --> 01:32:22.910
Subject's name
is Jamie Gumb. a.k.a John Grant.

876
01:32:23.210 --> 01:32:26.744
Lecter's description was accurate.
He just lied about the name.

877
01:32:26.880 --> 01:32:29.122
Customs had some paper on him.

878
01:32:29.257 --> 01:32:34.797
They stopped a carton two years ago
at LAX. Live caterpillars from Surinam.

879
01:32:34.930 --> 01:32:37.847
The addressee was a Jame Gumb.

880
01:32:38.433 --> 01:32:41.304
Chicago's only 400 miles from here.
I'll be there in...

881
01:32:41.436 --> 01:32:45.849
No. Starling. There's not enough time.
We want him for murder. not kidnapping.

882
01:32:45.982 --> 01:32:50.027
I need you to link him to the Bimmel girl.
See what you can dredge up in Belvedere.

883
01:32:50.153 --> 01:32:52.360
Yes. sir. you bet. I'll do my best.

884
01:32:52.489 --> 01:32:56.154
Starling. we wouldn't
have found him without you.

885
01:32:56.284 --> 01:32:59.784
Nobody's gonna forget that.
Least of all me.

886
01:33:01.164 --> 01:33:04.913
Thank you. sir.
Thank you very much. Mr Crawford.

887
01:33:06.169 --> 01:33:07.580
Mr Crawford?

888
01:33:20.142 --> 01:33:22.597
Thanks for the scraps. asshole.

889
01:33:22.727 --> 01:33:25.183
I got a better idea.

890
01:33:46.042 --> 01:33:48.913
OK. Precious. Time for a little treat.

891
01:34:01.600 --> 01:34:03.639
Precious!

892
01:34:05.479 --> 01:34:08.100
Come on. girl!

893
01:34:08.231 --> 01:34:10.722
Come on. Precious.

894
01:34:19.993 --> 01:34:21.867
Come on. Precious!

895
01:34:21.995 --> 01:34:26.242
I got a yummy snack for ya!
Come on. Come and get it.

896
01:34:33.215 --> 01:34:35.373
Precious!

897
01:34:35.509 --> 01:34:37.750
Are you up there. you little shit?

898
01:34:38.804 --> 01:34:41.508
Come and get it. pretty girl.

899
01:34:48.146 --> 01:34:51.811
Precious. please come. Come on.

900
01:35:13.421 --> 01:35:14.964
Would you fuck me?

901
01:35:15.382 --> 01:35:17.624
Come on. Take that bone.

902
01:35:22.222 --> 01:35:23.502
I'd fuck me.

903
01:35:24.349 --> 01:35:26.638
Come on.

904
01:35:29.604 --> 01:35:31.644
I'd fuck me hard.

905
01:35:31.773 --> 01:35:33.813
I'd fuck me so hard.

906
01:35:38.488 --> 01:35:39.651
No.

907
01:36:25.619 --> 01:36:30.031
AIR NATIONAL GUARD HQ
CHICAGO. IL

908
01:36:40.842 --> 01:36:44.674
Is that a good job. FBI agent?
You get to travel around and stuff?

909
01:36:44.805 --> 01:36:46.927
I mean. better places than this?

910
01:36:48.725 --> 01:36:51.014
Sometimes you do.

911
01:36:51.144 --> 01:36:55.557
Freddie was so happy for me
when I got this job at the bank.

912
01:36:55.690 --> 01:36:59.735
Toaster giveaways and Barry Manilow
on the speakers all day.

913
01:36:59.861 --> 01:37:02.648
She thought it was such hot shit.

914
01:37:02.781 --> 01:37:05.236
What did she know? Big dummy.

915
01:37:05.367 --> 01:37:11.322
Stacy. did Fredrica ever mention a man
named Jamie Gumb or a Jame Gumb?

916
01:37:12.123 --> 01:37:14.412
- How about John Grant?
- No.

917
01:37:14.543 --> 01:37:17.378
Would she have had a friend
you didn't know about?

918
01:37:17.504 --> 01:37:19.746
If she had a guy.
I'd have known. believe me.

919
01:37:19.881 --> 01:37:23.796
- Sewing was her life.
- Did you two ever work together?

920
01:37:23.927 --> 01:37:29.087
Sure. Me and Pam Malavesi used to help
her do alterations for old Mrs Lippman.

921
01:37:29.224 --> 01:37:32.842
Can you give me Mrs Lippman's address?
I need to talk to her.

922
01:37:33.353 --> 01:37:37.054
CALUMET CITY. IL

923
01:38:01.047 --> 01:38:03.965
So powerful. So beautiful.

924
01:38:09.514 --> 01:38:11.554
Precious?

925
01:38:16.771 --> 01:38:20.057
- Precious?
- She's down here. you sack of shit!

926
01:38:28.909 --> 01:38:33.369
- Put her in that bucket.
- Get me a telephone and lower it down.

927
01:38:36.625 --> 01:38:38.950
Poodlie-poo. Precious.

928
01:38:39.085 --> 01:38:43.664
- Darling heart. are you all right?
- She's in a lot of pain. She needs a vet.

929
01:38:47.928 --> 01:38:50.964
She broke her leg
on the way down. I know it.

930
01:38:51.097 --> 01:38:54.965
- Don't you hurt my dog!
- Don't you make me hurt your dog!

931
01:38:55.101 --> 01:38:57.308
You don't know what pain is!

932
01:39:10.784 --> 01:39:15.113
- Oh. fuck!
- You better be gettin' me that telephone!

933
01:39:15.455 --> 01:39:17.911
I'm gonna do it. mister!

934
01:39:22.129 --> 01:39:24.121
All right. mister! I'm doin' it!

935
01:39:47.445 --> 01:39:49.485
OK. I'm coming.

936
01:39:51.324 --> 01:39:53.364
We're goin' in.

937
01:39:57.497 --> 01:40:02.289
Good afternoon. Sorry to bother you.
I'm looking for Mrs Lippman's family.

938
01:40:02.961 --> 01:40:05.534
FBl! Everybody down!

939
01:40:05.672 --> 01:40:08.245
No. Lippmans don't live here any more.

940
01:40:08.383 --> 01:40:10.625
Excuse me.
I really need to speak with you.

941
01:40:11.845 --> 01:40:13.588
Clear!

942
01:40:14.431 --> 01:40:16.470
What's the problem. officer?

943
01:40:16.600 --> 01:40:19.351
I'm investigating the death
of Fredrica Bimmel.

944
01:40:22.939 --> 01:40:25.395
There's no one here. Jack.

945
01:40:26.985 --> 01:40:28.183
Clarice.

946
01:40:28.320 --> 01:40:31.071
- Your name is?
- Jack Gordon.

947
01:40:31.198 --> 01:40:36.358
Mr Gordon. Good. Well. Fredrica used to
work for Mrs Lippman. Did you know her?

948
01:40:37.370 --> 01:40:39.446
No. Uh-uh.

949
01:40:39.581 --> 01:40:41.241
Oh. wait.

950
01:40:41.374 --> 01:40:43.533
Was she a great. big. fat person?

951
01:40:44.461 --> 01:40:47.877
- She was a big girl. sir.
- Yeah. I may have...

952
01:40:48.006 --> 01:40:50.497
No. I read about her in the newspaper.

953
01:40:52.469 --> 01:40:55.007
Mrs Lippman had a son.
Maybe he could help you.

954
01:40:55.138 --> 01:40:58.092
I got his card here someplace.
Come in while I look for it.

955
01:40:58.225 --> 01:41:00.680
- May l?
- Yeah. sure.

956
01:41:19.579 --> 01:41:23.079
Are you close to catchin'
somebody. you think?

957
01:41:23.208 --> 01:41:25.247
Yes. We may be.

958
01:41:27.629 --> 01:41:32.706
Did you take over this place
after Mrs Lippman died. is that right?

959
01:41:34.719 --> 01:41:39.049
Yeah. I bought this house two years ago.

960
01:41:40.267 --> 01:41:43.718
Did she leave any records?
Any business records?

961
01:41:43.854 --> 01:41:47.139
Tax forms? List of employees?

962
01:41:48.150 --> 01:41:50.605
No. nothin' like that at all.

963
01:41:52.571 --> 01:41:55.488
Say. has the FBI learned something?

964
01:41:55.615 --> 01:41:59.447
The police around here
don't seem to have the first clue.

965
01:42:08.545 --> 01:42:14.500
I mean. have you got. like. a description.
fingerprints. anything like that?

966
01:42:14.634 --> 01:42:16.674
No.

967
01:42:18.263 --> 01:42:20.303
No. we don't.

968
01:42:30.984 --> 01:42:33.273
Here's that number.

969
01:42:34.029 --> 01:42:37.729
Very good. Mr Gordon.
May I use your phone. please?

970
01:42:45.874 --> 01:42:47.913
Sure. you can use my phone.

971
01:42:49.294 --> 01:42:52.414
Freeze! Put your hands over your head.

972
01:42:53.048 --> 01:42:56.168
And turn around. Spread your legs.

973
01:42:56.676 --> 01:42:59.843
Spread your legs.
Put your hands in the back. Thumbs up.

974
01:42:59.971 --> 01:43:02.011
Freeze!

975
01:44:36.109 --> 01:44:38.731
Hello? Are you there?

976
01:44:39.821 --> 01:44:42.277
I'm down here!

977
01:45:02.093 --> 01:45:04.763
- Catherine Martin?
- Yes!

978
01:45:07.015 --> 01:45:09.850
FBl. You're safe.

979
01:45:09.976 --> 01:45:12.432
Safe. shit! Get me outta here!

980
01:45:28.161 --> 01:45:31.495
- You're all right. Where is he?
- How the fuck should I know?

981
01:45:31.623 --> 01:45:35.751
- Just get me outta here!
- You gotta be quiet. Shut that dog up.

982
01:45:36.670 --> 01:45:38.746
Just get me outta here!

983
01:45:39.798 --> 01:45:41.837
Oh. my God.

984
01:45:43.510 --> 01:45:47.673
Catherine. I'm gonna get you outta there.
but right now you listen to me.

985
01:45:47.806 --> 01:45:50.048
I've gotta leave this room. Be right back.

986
01:45:50.183 --> 01:45:54.015
No! Don't you leave me here.
you fuckin' bitch!

987
01:45:54.146 --> 01:45:58.013
Don't you leave me here!
This guy's fuckin' crazy!

988
01:46:01.069 --> 01:46:02.943
Please!

989
01:46:03.071 --> 01:46:05.858
I gotta get outta here!

990
01:46:08.451 --> 01:46:13.197
Catherine. the other officers'll
be here any minute now.

991
01:46:13.331 --> 01:46:17.281
Wait! Don't go! Please!

992
01:46:17.419 --> 01:46:18.664
Quiet!

993
01:50:19.536 --> 01:50:22.620
- You OK?
- Gunpowder. It's nothing. I'm OK.

994
01:50:22.747 --> 01:50:25.036
How did you track Buffalo Bill here?

995
01:50:31.423 --> 01:50:33.462
Clarice M Starling.

996
01:50:36.303 --> 01:50:38.342
Congratulations.

997
01:51:11.880 --> 01:51:14.086
Special Agent Starling.

998
01:51:14.216 --> 01:51:16.837
- Special Agent Mapp.
- Phone call.

999
01:51:16.968 --> 01:51:19.008
- Excuse me.
- Starling.

1000
01:51:21.973 --> 01:51:24.429
Pilch. could you take our picture?

1001
01:51:24.559 --> 01:51:26.599
Yeah. Sure.

1002
01:51:27.521 --> 01:51:30.557
Look. I just wanted
to say congratulations.

1003
01:51:30.690 --> 01:51:34.391
I'm not much good at this kinda thing.
so I'm gonna duck outta here.

1004
01:51:34.528 --> 01:51:36.567
OK. Sure.

1005
01:51:37.531 --> 01:51:39.986
Thank you. Mr Crawford.

1006
01:51:47.290 --> 01:51:50.494
Your father would have been proud today.

1007
01:51:52.671 --> 01:51:55.126
Don't forget your phone call.

1008
01:51:59.177 --> 01:52:02.262
- Starling.
- Well. Clarice?

1009
01:52:02.848 --> 01:52:05.303
Have the lambs stopped screaming?

1010
01:52:05.725 --> 01:52:08.098
- Dr Lecter.
- Don't bother with the trace.

1011
01:52:08.228 --> 01:52:10.102
I won't be on long enough.

1012
01:52:13.692 --> 01:52:17.903
- Where are you. Dr Lecter?
- I have no plans to call on you. Clarice.

1013
01:52:18.029 --> 01:52:20.983
The world's more interesting
with you in it.

1014
01:52:21.116 --> 01:52:24.152
So you take care now
to extend me the same courtesy.

1015
01:52:24.286 --> 01:52:26.741
You know I can't make that promise.

1016
01:52:27.205 --> 01:52:29.577
I do wish we could chat longer but...

1017
01:52:31.001 --> 01:52:33.871
I'm having an old friend for dinner.

1018
01:52:35.088 --> 01:52:37.626
- Bye.
- Dr Lecter?

1019
01:52:40.635 --> 01:52:42.675
Dr Lecter?

1020
01:52:50.562 --> 01:52:53.516
Excuse me. You got
the security system all set up?

1021
01:52:53.648 --> 01:52:57.860
- We have the big-shot security.
- Thank you. I appreciate that.
